PostgreSQL connection settings for Azure-hosted (or local) database access via node-postgres (pg NPM package). Required for the MVP data-persistence layer in local dev & testing. Configure EITHER a single DATABASE_URL (postgresql://user:password@host:5432/resume_builder?sslmode=require) OR the discrete PGHOST / PGPORT / PGDATABASE / PGUSER / PGPASSWORD variables loaded at runtime by the pool initializer in api/db/pg-client. Leave PGPASSWORD blank to authenticate with Microsoft Entra ID (managed identity) using DefaultAzureCredential against PG_AAD_SCOPE (https://ossrdbms-aad.database.windows.net/.default); SSL is auto-enabled for *.postgres.database.azure.com hosts.
